  "version": "v286",
  "scope": "Exactly the 16 listed final PNGs were opened with view_image and independently read as original RGB pixels. Existing Native audit/state JSON and common run/title-layout JSON were read. Only this review JSON was written. No product changes, image edits/brightening, browser, GPU or test runs were performed.",
